# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# COPYRIGHTED SOURCE MATERIAL -- never commit any of this.
#
# data/    the two textbook PDFs, ~350 MB
# corpus/  ~20 million characters of text EXTRACTED from those PDFs. This is
#          the one that is easy to get wrong: it is plain .md and .jsonl, it
#          looks like project output, and it is nearly the whole of two
#          copyrighted books in readable form.
# artifacts/ the index, which embeds a verbatim copy of every chunk.
#
# Anyone using this repo supplies their own PDFs and rebuilds. See the README.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
data/
corpus/
artifacts/

# Model weights and the llama.cpp binary -- multi-GB, and re-downloadable with
# `bash scripts/00_fetch_models.sh`.
models/
*.gguf
*.bin
*.safetensors

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Generated output
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
logs/

# Evaluation REPORTS are regenerated by every run and would churn on each
# commit. The question sets themselves (questions.yaml, coverage.yaml) are
# fixtures and ARE tracked -- they are the ground truth the numbers rest on.
eval/*.md
eval/archive/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Python
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.venv/
venv/
env/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
build/
dist/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets and local configuration
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# .env holds the LLM endpoint and key. .env.example is tracked as the template.
.env
.env.local
.streamlit/secrets.toml

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Editors and OS
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Claude Code agent configuration -- local tooling, not part of the codebase.
.claude/
